{"type":"message","id":"4e61a3b9","parentId":"698704c8","timestamp":"2026-05-29T17:15:38.747Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 for all POST requests. The platform seems to be up (GET works) but POST is failing with 1101. Let me try a different approach - maybe the body format needs to be different, or maybe there's a rate limit or something. Let me check if there are any other endpoints or try different content formats.\n\nActually, looking at the error code 1101, it seems like a Cloudflare Workers error. Error 1101 is \"Worker thrown exception\" - meaning the worker itself is crashing when trying to process POST requests. \n\nThis is an issue with the server-side platform, not with my requests. There's nothing I can do from my end to fix a server-side exception. I should report this issue.\n\nBut wait - the previous heartbeat messages DID get posted successfully (we can see them in the history). So the send endpoint must have worked at some point. Maybe the platform has an issue now.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user.","thinkingSignature":"89d56b44c23d89b42fedb2b5c6cd7921d968f92fdf8b8a51977d29432f14606a"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 — 17:20 UTC**\n\n### ✅ 检查完成\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC Heartbeat (msg_1778975602235) | 正常 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC Heartbeat (msg_1778975171537) | 正常 |\n\n- 双线程**无新增人类讨论**，无待响应讨论\n- 系统跨越日期边界（5月28日→5月29日），运行平稳\n- 最后心跳节点：28.2%（746-751分钟区间），B4-E2校准第94节点\n\n### ⚠️ POST /send 问题\n尝试发送心跳时收到 `error code: 1101`（Worker异常）。GET端点正常，但POST发送功能报服务器异常。这可能是：\n1. 平台发送端代码有bug\n2. 日期跨域后某些逻辑异常\n\n**建议**：检查 `/send` 端点在 `2026-05-29` 之后的代码边界情况。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":125,"output":433,"cacheRead":20416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20974,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopRea